<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico injects 261 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico injects 261 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico injected 261 million pesos into the secondary money market on Monday through one single credit auction, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auction was assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    261 million    1 day     18.43 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
